00:08:02.189 --> 00:08:04.358
&gt;&gt; Bret: WHEN YOU HAVE

00:08:03.757 --> 00:08:08.028
HILLARY CLINTON AND LAURA BUSH

00:08:04.491 --> 00:08:09.797
ON THE SAME ISSUE, DOES IT

00:08:08.162 --> 00:08:11.565
