00:08:17.871 --> 00:08:22.409
THE OTHER ASPECT OF THE TWEET,

00:08:21.075 --> 00:08:24.211
HE WENT AFTER ANGELA MERKEL.

00:08:22.543 --> 00:08:26.413
SUGGESTING THAT HER HOLD ON

00:08:24.344 --> 00:08:27.414
POWER WAS TEETERING ON THE BRINK

00:08:26.547 --> 00:08:30.818
